# ⚙️ 4. BOOTSTRAP AUTOMATION

## ✅ scripts/bootstrap.sh

```
#!/bin/bash

echo "🚀 Bootstrap started"

export KUBECONFIG=/etc/kubernetes/admin.conf

apt update -y
apt install -y git

# Storage
kubectl apply -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rancher/local-path-provisioner/master/deploy/local-path-storage.yaml

# Ingress
kubectl apply -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/ingress-nginx/main/deploy/static/provider/cloud/deploy.yaml

# ArgoCD
kubectl create namespace argocd || true
kubectl apply -n argocd -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/argoproj/argo-cd/stable/manifests/install.yaml

# Wait for ArgoCD
kubectl wait --for=condition=available deployment argocd-server -n argocd --timeout=120s

# Clone GitOps repo
cd /home/ubuntu
git clone https://github.com/sohail-24/devops-ecommerce-kubeadm.git

cd devops-ecommerce-kubeadm

# Apply ArgoCD App
kubectl apply -f argocd/app.yaml

echo "✅ Bootstrap completed"
```

---

# 🚀 5. GITHUB ACTIONS (DEPLOY)

## ✅ .github/workflows/deploy.yml

```
name: Full DevOps Pipeline

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
    - uses: actions/checkout@v4

    - uses: hashicorp/setup-terraform@v3

    - run: terraform -chdir=terraform init
    - run: terraform -chdir=terraform apply -auto-approve

    - run: echo "MASTER_IP=$(terraform -chdir=terraform output -raw master_public_ip)" >> $GITHUB_ENV

    - run: |
        echo "${{ secrets.EC2_KEY }}" > key.pem
        chmod 400 key.pem

    - run: |
        until ssh -i key.pem -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no ubuntu@$MASTER_IP "echo ready"; do
          sleep 10
        done

    - run: sleep 120

    - run: |
        ssh -i key.pem ubuntu@$MASTER_IP "bash -s" < scripts/bootstrap.sh
```

---

# 💣 6. GITHUB ACTIONS (DESTROY)

## ✅ .github/workflows/destroy.yml

```
name: Destroy Infra

on:
  workflow_dispatch:

jobs:
  destroy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
    - uses: actions/checkout@v4
    - uses: hashicorp/setup-terraform@v3

    - run: terraform -chdir=terraform init
    - run: terraform -chdir=terraform destroy -auto-approve
```

---

# 🔐 7. GITHUB SECRETS

Add in GitHub:

```
EC2_KEY = <your .pem file content>
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
```

