# 📦 8. ARGOCD (GITOPS)

## ✅ argocd/app.yaml (IMPORTANT)

```
spec:
  source:
    repoURL: https://github.com/sohail-24/devops-ecommerce-kubeadm.git
    targetRevision: HEAD
    path: helm-charts/django-ecommerce

  destination:
    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc
    namespace: ecommerce

  syncPolicy:
    automated:
      prune: true
      selfHeal: true
```

